--- A list of ints read from text — each `int[w]` a growing int that can
--- fail — handed whole where numbers are taken is its numbers: compiled,
--- the conversion had cast a growing int `as f64` and not built (Rosetta
--- Code, 24 game).
use math

nums = for w in ['3', '1', '2']
    int[w]
log[sort[nums]]
log[sum[nums]]
log[max[nums]]
log[nums eq [3, 1, 2]]
